  "dct_description_sm": [
    "The overall aim is to assess the vulnerability of Greenland herds to global changes. This is achieved through an initial standardized 'snap-shot' of body health and condition allowing cross-herd comparisons. With extensive retrospective databases for some herds, and links to global changes, several relevant questions are examined. The goal is a time series of 'snap-shots' allowing temporal comparisons on the same herd."
